---
// 3-column methodology grid: Architect (ME) / Executor (AI) / Platform (STACK)
---

<section class="scope" id="methodology">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="ebar"></span>
        <span data-en>/ How I build</span>
        <span data-es>/ Cómo construyo</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <span data-en>Architect. Orchestrator. <span class="muted">Operator.</span></span>
        <span data-es>Arquitecto. Orquestador. <span class="muted">Operador.</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        <span data-en>I'm not just a dev with AI. I run the system. Decisions, system design, and code review stay with me. Execution is delegated — under engineering discipline.</span>
        <span data-es>No soy "un dev con IA". Yo corro el sistema. Decisiones, diseño y code review se quedan conmigo. La ejecución se delega — con disciplina de ingeniería.</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="meth-grid">
      <div class="meth-col">
        <div class="meth-role" data-en>01 · Architect · ME</div>
        <div class="meth-role" data-es>01 · Arquitecto · YO</div>
        <div class="meth-mark"><span class="ac">E</span>D<span class="ac">.</span></div>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-en>I frame the problem. I design the system.</h3>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-es>Encuadro el problema. Diseño el sistema.</h3>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-en>Where the business hurts. Where the data lives. What ships first. The decisions a tool can't make.</p>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-es>Dónde duele el negocio. Dónde vive el dato. Qué se ship primero. Las decisiones que una herramienta no puede tomar.</p>
        <ul class="meth-list">
          <li data-en>Business framing → product spec</li>
          <li data-es>Framing de negocio → spec de producto</li>
          <li data-en>Schema + boundary design</li>
          <li data-es>Diseño de schema + boundaries</li>
          <li data-en>PR review, every commit</li>
          <li data-es>PR review, todo commit</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="meth-col">
        <div class="meth-role" data-en>02 · Executor · AI</div>
        <div class="meth-role" data-es>02 · Ejecutor · IA</div>
        <div class="meth-mark">A<span class="ac">I</span></div>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-en>AI agents execute. Under discipline.</h3>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-es>Los agentes de IA ejecutan. Con disciplina.</h3>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-en>Claude Code, Cursor, Codex. Each gets a scoped task, a test target, and a review gate. Speed compounds; quality holds.</p>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-es>Claude Code, Cursor, Codex. Cada uno con tarea acotada, target de tests y gate de review. La velocidad compone; la calidad se mantiene.</p>
        <ul class="meth-list">
          <li>Claude Code · Cursor · Codex</li>
          <li data-en>Scoped prompts, no vibe-coding</li>
          <li data-es>Prompts acotados, sin vibe-coding</li>
          <li data-en>Test-gated PRs</li>
          <li data-es>PRs con test-gate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="meth-col">
        <div class="meth-role" data-en>03 · Platform · STACK</div>
        <div class="meth-role" data-es>03 · Plataforma · STACK</div>
        <div class="meth-mark">TS<span class="ac">/</span></div>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-en>A boring, durable stack.</h3>
        <h3 class="meth-title" data-es>Un stack aburrido y durable.</h3>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-en>TypeScript everywhere. Supabase as the data + auth layer. Astro/Next for delivery. GSAP when motion earns its place.</p>
        <p class="meth-desc" data-es>TypeScript en todo. Supabase como capa de datos + auth. Astro/Next para delivery. GSAP cuando la animación lo merece.</p>
        <ul class="meth-list">
          <li>TypeScript · React · Astro 5</li>
          <li>Supabase · Postgres · RLS</li>
          <li>WhatsApp Cloud API · GSAP</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section.scope {
    position: relative;
    padding: 140px 0 32px;
  }
  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 72px;
    max-width: 880px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5.4vw, 64px);
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
  }
  .section-title :global(.muted) {
    color: var(--color-text-3);
  }
  .section-lede {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-3);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .eyebrow .ebar {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 3px;
    height: 11px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    animation: blink 1.2s steps(2, start) infinite;
  }

  .meth-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--color-hair);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hair);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .meth-col {
    background: var(--color-surface-1);
    padding: 40px 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 200ms;
  }
  .meth-col:hover {
    background: var(--color-surface-2);
  }
  .meth-role {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .meth-mark {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 88px;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .meth-mark .ac {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .meth-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-text-1);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .meth-desc {
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .meth-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: auto 0 0;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-hair-strong);
    padding-top: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .meth-list li {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text-2);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 18px 1fr;
    gap: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .meth-list li::before {
    content: "→";
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .meth-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
